{
  "id": "stmt:fda:iclusig:2:0",
  "type": "Statement",
  "description": "The U.S. Food and Drug Administration granted approval to ponatinib for the treatment of adult patients with T315I-positive chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) in chronic phase, accelerated phase, or blast phase. The product label states the following limitations of use: ponatinib is not indicated and is not recommended for the treatment of patients with newly diagnosed CP-CML.",
